<title>HONG KONG: China Construction Bank seen issuing $200 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>China Construction Bank seen issuing $200 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Construction Bank will launch a US$200 million floating rate note issue in bond-style shortly, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the deal will carry a maturity of five years and the all-in return will be in the high-30's over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>China Construction Bank is rated Baa1 by Moody's Investors Service.</p>
<p>Sources said Daiwa Securities, Merrill Lynch Far East, Bayerisch Landesbank Hong Kong and Sakura Finance Asia will lead the deal.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
